{"id":"proyecto","lemma":"proyecto","pos":"noun","rank":1016,"glosses":["project, plan"],"ipa":"/pɾoˈʝeɡto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"proyectos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-proyecto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Este es mi proyecto.","en":"That's my plan.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799440","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"¿Estás a favor o en contra del proyecto?","en":"Are you for or against the project?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687556","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,{"g":"or"},null,null,{"g":"of the"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"in favour"],[4,6,"against"]]},{"text":"Estoy en contra de este proyecto de ley.","en":"I'm against the bill.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800788","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,null,{"g":"this"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,4,"against"],[6,8,"indeed"]]},{"text":"¿Hablaste con él acerca de tus proyectos?","en":"Did you speak with him about your projects?","words":[{"g":"to talk","l":"hablar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"he"},null,null,{"g":"your"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"about, concerning"]]},{"text":"El proyecto de ley salió adelante.","en":"The bill went through.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301884","words":[{"g":"the"},null,null,null,{"g":"to go out","l":"salir"},{"g":"forward"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"indeed"]]}]}